Libs\exui\exui.xml

# Bindings.xml is deliberately absent from this list: the client auto-loads
# any root-level file named exactly "Bindings.xml" for every enabled addon,
# independent of the .toc — listing it here would load it (and register its
# bindings) twice. It declares WISE_OPEN_OPTIONS for Blizzard's Key Bindings
# UI (including its Gamepad tab) and ConsolePort_Config, which reads the same
# BINDING_HEADER_*/BINDING_NAME_* globals (see core/Bindings.lua).

